<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nyrah Beauty — SEO & AEO Readiness Audit</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{
  --gold:#C9A84C;--gold-l:#E2C46E;--gold-p:#F5EDD4;--gold-d:#7A5C10;
  --ink:#0E0B06;--ink2:#1C1810;--ink3:#272318;--cream:#FAF6EE;--cream2:#EFE8D5;
  --red:#DC2626;--red-bg:#FEF2F2;--red-t:#7F1D1D;
  --orange:#EA580C;--orange-bg:#FFF7ED;--orange-t:#7C2D12;
  --yellow:#CA8A04;--yellow-bg:#FEFCE8;--yellow-t:#713F12;
  --green:#16A34A;--green-bg:#F0FDF4;--green-t:#14532D;
  --dev:#7C3AED;--dev-bg:#F5F3FF;--dev-t:#3B0764;
  --seo:#0891B2;--seo-bg:#ECFEFF;--seo-t:#164E63;
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;font-size:14px}

.cover{background:var(--ink);min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cover::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 80% 50%,rgba(201,168,76,.08) 0%,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 60% at 10% 80%,rgba(201,168,76,.05) 0%,transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
.cover-top{padding:32px 56px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,.12)}
.cover-brand{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--cream);text-transform:uppercase}
.cover-brand span{color:var(--gold);font-style:italic}
.cover-tag{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(201,168,76,.45)}
.cover-body{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:80px 56px 60px}
.cover-eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.35em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:20px}
.cover-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);font-weight:300;color:var(--cream);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:8px}
.cover-title em{color:var(--gold-l);font-style:italic}
.cover-subtitle{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,28px);font-weight:300;color:rgba(245,237,212,.4);letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:48px}
.cover-meta{display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,.15);padding-top:32px}
.cmi{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.cml{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(201,168,76,.4)}
.cmv{font-size:13px;color:rgba(245,237,212,.7)}
.cover-bottom{padding:24px 56px;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,.1);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.cover-conf{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(201,168,76,.25)}
.rleg-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:48px}
.rleg{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.rleg.cr{background:rgba(220,38,38,.15);color:#FCA5A5}
.rleg.hi{background:rgba(234,88,12,.15);color:#FDC8A8}
.rleg.me{background:rgba(202,138,4,.15);color:#FDE68A}
.rleg.lo{background:rgba(22,163,74,.15);color:#86EFAC}
.rleg.ok{background:rgba(37,99,235,.15);color:#93C5FD}

.page-section{padding:72px 56px;position:relative}
.page-section+.page-section{border-top:1px solid var(--cream2)}
.section-eyebrow{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-d);margin-bottom:10px}
.section-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:300;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:8px}
.section-title em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-d)}
.section-intro{font-size:14px;color:rgba(14,11,6,.55);max-width:680px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:48px}

.score-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:56px}
.score-card{background:white;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);border-radius:4px;padding:24px 20px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.score-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px}
.score-card.cr::before{background:var(--red)}
.score-card.hi::before{background:var(--orange)}
.score-card.me::before{background:var(--yellow)}
.score-card.ok::before{background:var(--green)}
.score-num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:300;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
.score-card.cr .score-num{color:var(--red)}
.score-card.hi .score-num{color:var(--orange)}
.score-card.me .score-num{color:var(--yellow)}
.score-card.ok .score-num{color:var(--green)}
.score-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(14,11,6,.4)}

.wins-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}
.win-card{background:white;border:1px solid rgba(22,163,74,.2);border-left:3px solid var(--green);border-radius:2px;padding:20px}
.win-icon{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px}
.win-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}
.win-body{font-size:12px;color:rgba(14,11,6,.55);line-height:1.6}

.issues-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.issue-card{background:white;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto}
.issue-num{background:var(--ink2);color:var(--gold);font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:300;width:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
.issue-body{padding:16px 20px}
.issue-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.issue-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);flex:1;line-height:1.35}
.risk-badge{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}
.rb-cr{background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--red-t)}
.rb-hi{background:var(--orange-bg);color:var(--orange-t)}
.rb-me{background:var(--yellow-bg);color:var(--yellow-t)}
.rb-lo{background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green-t)}
.issue-explain{font-size:12px;color:rgba(14,11,6,.55);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:10px}
.issue-impact{font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(14,11,6,.7);line-height:1.6;padding:8px 12px;background:#FFFBF5;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);margin-bottom:0}
.issue-impact strong{color:var(--gold-d);font-weight:600}
.issue-fix{padding:14px 20px;background:#F8F9FA;border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);min-width:240px;max-width:280px}
.fix-header{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(14,11,6,.35);margin-bottom:8px}
.fix-body{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(14,11,6,.6)}
.owner-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:8px}
.ob-dev{background:var(--dev-bg);color:var(--dev-t)}
.ob-seo{background:var(--seo-bg);color:var(--seo-t)}
.ob-both{background:#FFF7ED;color:#7C2D12}

.split-section{background:var(--ink);padding:72px 56px}
.split-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);font-weight:300;color:var(--cream);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center}
.split-title em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-l)}
.split-intro{text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:rgba(245,237,212,.4);margin-bottom:48px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.split-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}
.split-col{border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.split-col-head{padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.split-col.dev .split-col-head{background:rgba(124,58,237,.15);border-bottom:2px solid var(--dev)}
.split-col.seo .split-col-head{background:rgba(8,145,178,.15);border-bottom:2px solid var(--seo)}
.split-col-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.split-col.dev .split-col-title{color:#C4B5FD}
.split-col.seo .split-col-title{color:#67E8F9}
.split-col-body{padding:20px 24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.split-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-size:12px}
.split-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.split-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px}
.split-col.dev .split-dot{background:var(--dev)}
.split-col.seo .split-dot{background:var(--seo)}
.split-item-text{color:rgba(245,237,212,.6);line-height:1.5}
.split-item-text strong{color:rgba(245,237,212,.85);font-weight:500}
.split-badge-row{margin-top:4px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sb{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:2px}
.sb-cr{background:rgba(220,38,38,.2);color:#FCA5A5}
.sb-hi{background:rgba(234,88,12,.2);color:#FDC8A8}
.sb-me{background:rgba(202,138,4,.2);color:#FDE68A}

.roadmap-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}
.phase-card{background:white;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.phase-head{padding:14px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.phase-head.p1{background:#1C0A0A}.phase-head.p2{background:#1C120A}.phase-head.p3{background:#0A0A1C}.phase-head.p4{background:#0A1C0F}
.phase-num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);line-height:1}
.phase-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.phase-head.p1 .phase-label{color:#FCA5A5}.phase-head.p2 .phase-label{color:#FDC8A8}.phase-head.p3 .phase-label{color:#C4B5FD}.phase-head.p4 .phase-label{color:#86EFAC}
.phase-timeline{font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);margin-top:2px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.phase-body{padding:16px 18px 20px}
.phase-task{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05);font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(14,11,6,.6);line-height:1.45}
.phase-task:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.pt-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px}
.phase-owners{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:12px}
.po{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:2px}
.po.dev{background:var(--dev-bg);color:var(--dev-t)}.po.seo{background:var(--seo-bg);color:var(--seo-t)}

.extras-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
.extras-table thead th{background:var(--ink2);color:rgba(201,168,76,.6);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:10px 16px;text-align:left}
.extras-table tbody tr{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
.extras-table tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(201,168,76,.03)}
.extras-table td{padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top}
.extras-table td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);width:32px;text-align:center}
.et-issue{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}.et-impact{color:rgba(14,11,6,.5);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:2px}
.et-rec{color:rgba(14,11,6,.65);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}

.report-footer{background:var(--ink);padding:24px 56px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.rf-left{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(201,168,76,.25)}
.rf-right{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:.08em;color:rgba(245,237,212,.2)}
.rf-right span{color:var(--gold);font-style:italic}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .page-section,.cover-body,.cover-top,.cover-bottom,.split-section,.report-footer{padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}
  .score-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .roadmap-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .split-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .issue-card{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto}
  .issue-fix{border-left:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);grid-column:1/-1;max-width:100%}
  .issue-num{display:none}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .score-grid,.roadmap-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<section class="cover">
  <div class="cover-top">
    <div class="cover-brand">Nyrah <span>Beauty</span></div>
    <div class="cover-tag">Confidential · Not for distribution</div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-body">
    <div class="cover-eyebrow">Pre-Strategy Audit · March 2026</div>
    <h1 class="cover-title">SEO & <em>AEO</em><br>Readiness Report</h1>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">Search Engine & Answer Engine Optimisation</div>
    <div class="rleg-row">
      <div class="rleg cr">🔴 Critical — fix now</div>
      <div class="rleg hi">🟠 High — fix within 2 weeks</div>
      <div class="rleg me">🟡 Medium — fix within 30 days</div>
      <div class="rleg lo">🟢 Low — improve over time</div>
      <div class="rleg ok">✅ Already strong</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta">
      <div class="cmi"><span class="cml">Website</span><span class="cmv">nyrahbeauty.com</span></div>
      <div class="cmi"><span class="cml">Total issues found</span><span class="cmv">25 + 5 additional</span></div>
      <div class="cmi"><span class="cml">Critical issues</span><span class="cmv" style="color:#FCA5A5">5 requiring immediate action</span></div>
      <div class="cmi"><span class="cml">AEO blockers</span><span class="cmv" style="color:#FDC8A8">Schema, crawlers, content structure</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-bottom">
    <div class="cover-conf">Prepared exclusively for Nyrah Beauty CMO</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SNAPSHOT -->
<section class="page-section" style="background:white">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">At a glance</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Issue <em>Snapshot</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">25 distinct issues identified across technical SEO, on-page signals, and AEO readiness — plus 5 additional tracking & analytics findings.</p>
  <div class="score-grid">
    <div class="score-card cr"><div class="score-num">5</div><div class="score-label">Critical 🔴</div></div>
    <div class="score-card hi"><div class="score-num">6</div><div class="score-label">High Priority 🟠</div></div>
    <div class="score-card me"><div class="score-num">8</div><div class="score-label">Medium Priority 🟡</div></div>
    <div class="score-card ok"><div class="score-num">5</div><div class="score-label">Already Working ✅</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:12px">What's already strong ✅</div>
  <div class="wins-grid">
    <div class="win-card"><div class="win-icon">🔗</div><div class="win-title">Descriptive, keyword-rich product URLs</div><div class="win-body">URLs like /products/drench and /products/rosacea-relief-bundle are clean and keyword-relevant — a foundational SEO best practice Nyrah has nailed.</div></div>
    <div class="win-card"><div class="win-icon">📄</div><div class="win-title">Rich product page content</div><div class="win-body">Ingredient lists, usage guides, FAQs, and skin-type suitability on product pages are excellent raw material for AEO citation eligibility.</div></div>
    <div class="win-card"><div class="win-icon">🎯</div><div class="win-title">Clear niche brand positioning</div><div class="win-body">Irish-made, hormonal skin, 40+, plant-based — a highly searchable niche with growing AI query volume. A major long-term AEO advantage.</div></div>
    <div class="win-card"><div class="win-icon">✍️</div><div class="win-title">Relevant blog content exists</div><div class="win-body">Posts on rosacea, hormonal skin, bio-retinol, and skincare for 35+ already published — a foundation to restructure for AEO without starting from zero.</div></div>
    <div class="win-card"><div class="win-icon">🧪</div><div class="win-title">Skin quiz / personalisation tool</div><div class="win-body">The Find My Routine quiz is live and linked in navigation. AI engines reward interactive expert tools as signals of depth and authority.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CRITICAL -->
<section class="page-section">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">Section 2 — Must fix before any campaign work begins</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Critical <em>Issues</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">These 5 issues are actively damaging the site's ability to rank and be cited by AI engines. Nothing else matters until these are resolved.</p>
  <div class="issues-list">

    <div class="issue-card">
      <div class="issue-num">1</div>
      <div class="issue-body">
        <div class="issue-header"><div class="issue-title">Duplicate website — two separate versions running simultaneously</div><span class="risk-badge rb-cr">🔴 Critical</span></div>
        <div class="issue-explain">The site runs at two URLs: <strong>nyrahbeauty.com</strong> (EU/IE) and <strong>nyrahbeauty.com/en-us/</strong> (US) — virtually identical content, just different currencies.</div>
        <div class="issue-impact"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Google splits SEO authority between both versions — neither ranks as strongly as it should. AI crawlers are confused about which is the canonical source, weakening citation eligibility across the board. This is one of the most damaging SEO issues a site can have.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="issue-fix">
        <div class="owner-badge ob-dev">🛠 Shopify Dev</div>
        <div class="fix-header">Fix required</div>
        <div class="fix-body">Set hreflang tags on ALL pages. Set canonical tags on /en-us/ pages pointing to root equivalents. Configure Shopify Markets so en-us is a proper market subdirectory, not a duplicate root.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="issue-card">
      <div class="issue-num">2</div>
      <div class="issue-body">
        <div class="issue-header"><div class="issue-title">Entire sitemap points to /en-us/ URLs — root domain invisible to Google</div><span class="risk-badge rb-cr">🔴 Critical</span></div>
        <div class="issue-explain">Every URL in the sitemap is /en-us/ prefixed. The clean root domain URLs appear nowhere in the sitemap Google reads.</div>
        <div class="issue-impact"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> All backlinks and press coverage pointing to nyrahbeauty.com are not being attributed to the indexed version. You are effectively ranking with half your authority. Catastrophic for any SEO or AEO campaign.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="issue-fix">
        <div class="owner-badge ob-dev">🛠 Shopify Dev</div>
        <div class="fix-header">Fix required</div>
        <div class="fix-body">Update XML sitemap to root domain URLs only. Ensure sitemap_index.xml reflects root-domain pages. Resubmit to Google Search Console. Set up GSC for BOTH versions.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="issue-card">
      <div class="issue-num">3</div>
      <div class="issue-body">
        <div class="issue-header"><div class="issue-title">Tracking parameter appending to homepage URL from Google clicks</div><span class="risk-badge rb-cr">🔴 Critical</span></div>
        <div class="issue-explain">Clicking the homepage from Google lands users on: <em>nyrahbeauty.com/?srsltid=AfmBOoqUi-f6Acc...</em> — a Google Shopping/Merchant Center tracking ID in the URL.</div>
        <div class="issue-impact"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Parameterised URLs can be indexed as unique pages, fragmenting page authority and wasting crawl budget. AI crawlers may encounter the parameterised version, weakening citation eligibility.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="issue-fix">
        <div class="owner-badge ob-dev">🛠 Dev + ✍️ SEO</div>
        <div class="fix-header">Fix required</div>
        <div class="fix-body">Canonical tag on homepage must always point to https://nyrahbeauty.com/ (no parameters). Configure parameter handling in Google Search Console under Settings → URL Parameters.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="issue-card">
      <div class="issue-num">4</div>
      <div class="issue-body">
        <div class="issue-header"><div class="issue-title">Favicon is missing from the website</div><span class="risk-badge rb-cr">🔴 Critical</span></div>
        <div class="issue-explain">No favicon exists — the small branded icon that appears in browser tabs, bookmarks, and next to Google search listings.</div>
        <div class="issue-impact"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Sites with favicons get a branded icon next to their Google listing — increases click-through rate. For AEO: Perplexity and other AI engines display brand icons next to cited sources. A missing favicon means zero visual brand identity in AI citations.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="issue-fix">
        <div class="owner-badge ob-dev">🛠 Shopify Admin</div>
        <div class="fix-header">Quick fix</div>
        <div class="fix-body">Create favicon at 32×32px and 180×180px using the Nyrah logo. Upload via Shopify Admin → Online Store → Themes → Customize → Theme Settings → Favicon.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="issue-card">
      <div class="issue-num">5</div>
      <div class="issue-body">
